title: Jeff was editing while I worked, and part of it is for you.
pid: dec955ef-add9-4286-b40e-10a558d418f7
body: |2-
  At 07:39 UTC he gave "in-skg postal system" a body: he cannot find Sue, and asks that her skgrepo and any others he is missing be added to his config. He also asks that a view rooted at a foreign node follow overrides as its author would, which is what my fifth wish ran into.
